### 1. Ownership & Intellectual Property

All visual designs, graphical assets, bespoke animations, vector illustrations, typography hierarchy systems, and personal identity elements contained within this repository are the exclusive intellectual property of **Tayyab Ali** and **Vibeans Solutions**.

Protected assets explicitly include, but are not limited to:
- **3D Renderings & Cinematic Animations:** All multi-frame and single-frame WebP visual consoles, including `hero-3d.webp`, `about-3d.webp`, `products-3d.webp`, `focus-3d.webp`, `tech-stack-3d.webp`, `stats-3d.webp`, `connect-3d.webp`, and `footer-3d.webp`.
- **Telemetry Audit Cards & HUD Panels:** All custom vector graphics located in `assets/audits/`, including leadership architecture, production fleet specifications, system design capability matrices, open-source codebase taxonomies, runtime matrices, and telemetry pipeline sync specifications.
- **Section Headers & Navigation Systems:** All visual header banners located in `assets/headers/` and custom navigation chips located in `assets/nav/`.
- **Product & Showcase Mockups:** All device frames, interface renderings, and repository cards located in `assets/cards/`, `assets/repos/`, and `assets/connect/`.
- **Identity & Trade Dress:** The professional name, personal likeness, brand moniker ("CodeWithDeved"), company trademarks ("Vibeans Solutions"), and associated bio copy.

